  "transition_to_phase": 8,
  "disable_ai": true,
  "description": "Codex: Orks (11e) GLOWIN' DAKKA (Shoota Boyz) through the real unit_selected_to_shoot WINDOW. Setup-only: P1 switched to Shoota Boyz, the Prosecutors (T3, Sv3+, no invulnerable save) moved unengaged ~8\" (inside 9\") in front of Gretchin D with inflated wounds, defender auto-allocates. A real click on the Gretchin token opens the StratagemDialog offering all three Shoota Boyz stratagems, with an enabled 'Use on Gretchin Beta' on GLOWIN' DAKKA. A real click spends 1 CP; the forecast shows Glowin' Dakka. Confirm + Fast + Done resolve the grot blastas (AP0): the Prosecutors' saves are rolled against AP-1 — 3+ armour becomes 4+ (11e 02.02.06: improving AP 0 by 1 gives AP-1).",
